  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish contribution to joint administrative costs TIPH 2013-15</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish contribution to joint administrative costs to Temporary International Presence in the city of Hebron (TIPH) 2016-2016. The objective of this contribution is to support TIPH in carrying out its mandate to monitor and report on efforts to maintain normal life in Hebron, and creating and upholding a feeling of security among Palestinians in Hebron. Denmark has together with Norway, Sweden, Switzerland, Italy and Turkey participated in TIPH since 1997.</narrative>
  </description>
